{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hti-toys-fun-sand-art-bottle-kit-2607-0020","content_id":"d5fcb39c-4b6f-4a58-a971-60f79cda2a49","description":"Product Recall for HTI Toys Fun Sand Art Bottle Kit presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"412abb20-f2c3-4916-bc7c-0733bd7560ce","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-21T15:04:35+01:00","id":"412abb20-f2c3-4916-bc7c-0733bd7560ce","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-21T15:04:35+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6ab13973086ce7c57b8187b3/2607-0020-product-recall-HTI-fun-sand-art-bottle-kit.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: HTI Toys Fun Sand Art Bottle Kit sold by Curious Minds (Grasshopper Toys)</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk to health as the sand may be contaminated with a quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by HTI Toys (manufacturer) and the retailer Curious Minds (Grasshopper Toys).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Sensory Toys</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>HTI</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5050837373315</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>HTI Item Number</td>\n      <td>1373773</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>HTI Batch Code</td>\n      <td>15TT1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Kit with multiple colours of sand.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_412abb20-f2c3-4916-bc7c-0733bd7560ce\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6ab13973086ce7c57b8187b3/2607-0020-product-recall-HTI-fun-sand-art-bottle-kit.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand in the kit may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by HTI Toys (manufacturer) and retailer Curious Minds (Grasshopper Toys).</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using the product immediately and return it to Grasshopper Toys for a full refund. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the product.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, access the HTI Group website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.htigroup.co.uk/portfolio-item/recall-information/\">https://www.htigroup.co.uk/portfolio-item/recall-information/</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.</li>\n  <li>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.</li>\n  <li>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.</li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.</li>\n  <li>Return the product to Grasshopper Toys for a full refund. You do not need to provide the receipt.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to Grasshopper Toys follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact Grasshopper Toys or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">GOV.UK page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2607-0020</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Updated to expand recall, to manufacturer level.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:06:50Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-01T16:12:35Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-01","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-01T17:12:35+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hti-toys-fun-sand-art-bottle-kit-2607-0020","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hti-toys-fun-sand-art-bottle-kit-2607-0020","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hti-toys-fun-sand-art-bottle-kit-2607-0020","content_id":"d5fcb39c-4b6f-4a58-a971-60f79cda2a49","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},